I'm coming! Aah!

803
00:40:45.222 --> 00:40:47.956
Fuck!

804
00:40:53.897 --> 00:40:55.163
Aah!

805
00:40:58.268 --> 00:41:00.235
[Beads clacking]

806
00:41:05.042 --> 00:41:08.010
